OL,3,GNEWSAWarning after victim handed over
OL,4,Amoney to fraudsters
OL,5,
OL,6,FFraudsters have been calling
OL,7,Funsuspected victims and tricking them
OL,8,Finto transferring money over to them, a
OL,9,Fpolice force has warned.
OL,11,FMerseyside Police said one victim
OL,12,Ftransferred what the force said was a
OL,13,Fsignificant amount of money.
OL,15,FThe force said the criminals pretended
OL,16,Fto be detectives investigating identity
OL,17,Fthefts in order to get people to give
OL,18,Fthem their bank details or information
OL,19,Fabout any cryptocurrency they might
OL,20,Fhave.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
